            ^"Abilities" STRING "Area Lore: Central Italy 3 (hospitals and leper colonies), Awareness 3 (babies), Charm 2 (children), Chirurgy 2 (sores), Church Lore 1 (5) (Franciscans), Concentration 3 (prayer), Etiquette 2 (urban poor), Folk Ken 4 (poor townswomen), Organization Lore: Franciscans 2 (Poor Sisters), Profession: Herbwife 2 (Sleep), Profession: Washerwoman 2 (woolen cloth); Housewife 2 (cooking), Italian 5 (consolation), Stealth 2 (urban)"
